,"homepage":"https://www.elastic.co/products/elasticsearch","size":1565839,"stargazers_count":76300,"watchers_count":76300,"language":"Java","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":25807,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":5588,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":["elasticsearch","java","search-engine"],"visibility":"public","forks":25807,"open_issues":5588,"watchers":76300,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"Env : ES 1.4.1, Windows Server 2012 R2 Standard, Intel Xeon E7-4870, ES_HEAP_SIZE = 3g\nHaving a single node, 45 shards, no replicas, 190 GB of data.\nNo indexing/searching is running against the node.\nCreated a repository on the local drive : \n\n``` json\n{\n   \"my_backup\": {\n      \"type\": \"fs\",\n      \"settings\": {\n         \"compress\": \"true\",\n         \"location\": \"C:/ES/BackUp\",\n         \"max_snapshot_bytes_per_sec\": \"-1\"\n      }\n   }\n}\n```\n\nStarted a snapshot : \n\n> PUT _snapshot/my_backup/snapshot_1\n\nAfter half an hour of running, the backup folder has only 170 MB, the snapshot status is :\n\n``` json\n      {\n         \"snapshot\": \"snapshot_1\",\n         \"repository\": \"my_backup\",\n         \"state\": \"STARTED\",\n         \"shards_stats\": {\n            \"initializing\": 41,\n            \"started\": 4,\n            \"finalizing\": 0,\n            \"done\": 0,\n            \"failed\": 0,\n            \"total\": 45\n         },\n         \"stats\": {\n            \"number_of_files\": 1103,\n            \"processed_files\": 20,\n            \"total_size_in_bytes\": 20020458715,\n            \"processed_size_in_bytes\": 46249254,\n            \"start_time_in_millis\": 0,\n            \"time_in_millis\": 0\n         },\n         \"indices\": {\n         ...\n         }\n       }\n```\n\nThe disk isn't heavy used at all, the same for memory, cpu (screenshots attached)\nWhat are the recommendations to speed up the snapshot process ?\nFewer shards / shared network disk as storage don't help in any way.\n\n![cpu_memory](https://cloud.githubusercontent.com/assets/1536989/5406043/7c116ad4-8162-11e4-861b-bf0c89eb0d20.png)\n![disk_usage](https://cloud.githubusercontent.com/assets/1536989/5406044/7c33aa54-8162-11e4-9ba6-62b8db30647a.png)\n![visual_vm](https://cloud.githubusercontent.com/assets/1536989/5406042/7bcb54ae-8162-11e4-92e9-b34ec2330be5.png)\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/8914/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/8914/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":208221580,"node_id":"MDE3OlJlbmFtZWRUaXRsZUV2ZW50MjA4MjIxNTgw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/events/208221580","actor":{"login":"clintongormley","id":56599,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2NTk5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56599?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clintongormley","html_url":"https://github.com/clintongormley","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clintongormley/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clintongormley/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clintongormley/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clintongormley/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clintongormley/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com